  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0xA000" flags="0x0">
    <title>KP: Flowmeter MAF / Load (alias of old Torque table)</title>
    <description>KP identifies this area as Flowmeter MAF / LOAD-RPM. Old XDF named it Torque. Verify scaling before performance tuning.</description>
